/*
 *	Shattered World's Standard Weapon Generator.
 *
 *	By Dredd the Dreddfullest.
 *	(geoff@bruce.cs.monash.edu.au).
 *
 *	Alterered by Heroic so it could handle more weapons! The old one
 *	died with a "yacc stack overflow".
 *
 *	Modified by Jenna to create distance weapons and projectiles.
 *
 *	make() can accept an array of strings, from which one will be 
 *	randomly chosen and used as the weapon. 
 *	make() with no argument makes a random weapon.  
 *
 *  19980517 Persistence changes
 */

